        Beyond Accuracy: A Multi-Dimensional Framework for Evaluating Enterprise <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> AI Systems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mehta%2C+S">Sushant Mehta</a>
      
