        Knowledge-Grounded <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> Large Language Models for Multi-Hazard Understanding from Reconnaissance Reports
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kuai%2C+C">Chenchen Kuai</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Z">Zihao Li</a>, 
      
