        CorrectAD: A Self-Correcting <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> System to Improve End-to-end Planning in Autonomous Driving
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ma%2C+E">Enhui Ma</a>, 
      
